meta {
  name: Get Product by SKU
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{bestbuy_base_url}}/v1/products(sku={{sku}})?apiKey={{bestbuy_api_key}}&format=json&show=sku,upc,name,modelNumber,manufacturer,condition,type,regularPrice,salePrice,onSale,clearance,dollarSavings,percentSavings,priceUpdateDate,active,orderable,inStoreAvailability,onlineAvailability,inStorePickup,homeDelivery,freeShipping,freeShippingEligible,quantityLimit,url,image,longDescription,shortDescription,color,customerReviewAverage,customerReviewCount&pageSize=1
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  apiKey: {{bestbuy_api_key}}
  format: json
  show: sku,upc,name,modelNumber,manufacturer,condition,type,regularPrice,salePrice,onSale,clearance,dollarSavings,percentSavings,priceUpdateDate,active,orderable,inStoreAvailability,onlineAvailability,inStorePickup,homeDelivery,freeShipping,freeShippingEligible,quantityLimit,url,image,longDescription,shortDescription,color,customerReviewAverage,customerReviewCount
  pageSize: 1
}

vars:pre-request {
  sku: 6576689
}

docs {
  # Get Best Buy Product by SKU
  
  Fetches product details from Best Buy using the product SKU.
  
  ## Finding the SKU
  
  The SKU can be found on any Best Buy product page, typically labeled as "SKU" in the product details section.
  
  ## Example SKUs
  
  - `6576689` - iBUYPOWER Y40 Gaming Desktop (Sold Out example)
  - `6505727` - Samsung 65" Class OLED S90D Series Smart TV
  - `6525425` - Apple MacBook Air 13.6"
  
  ## Key Response Fields
  
  ### Pricing
  - `regularPrice` - Original/retail price
  - `salePrice` - Current sale price
  - `onSale` - Whether product is on sale
  - `clearance` - Whether it's a clearance item
  - `dollarSavings` - Amount saved in dollars
  - `percentSavings` - Percentage discount
  
  ### Availability (Critical for stock detection)
  - `orderable` - "SoldOut" or "Available"
  - `onlineAvailability` - Can purchase online
  - `inStoreAvailability` - Can purchase in store
  - `active` - Product is still listed
  
  ### Product Info
  - `sku` - Product SKU
  - `upc` - Universal Product Code
  - `name` - Product name
  - `manufacturer` - Brand name
  - `modelNumber` - Model number
  - `condition` - New, Refurbished, etc.
  
  ### Reviews
  - `customerReviewAverage` - Average rating (1-5)
  - `customerReviewCount` - Number of reviews
}
